</a></li></ul></nav></div><div class="header__main-panel-login"><div class="header-dropdown"><button type="button" class="button button--primary button--large w-full" id="login-id--Raecveokq-" aria-controls="dropdown-menu--Raecveokq-" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true"><span class="button__label">Login</span></button><div class="header-dropdown__menu " role="menu" id="dropdown-menu--Raecveokq-" aria-labelledby="login-id--Raecveokq-"><div class="header-dropdown__menu-item"><a role="menuitem" class="header-dropdown__menu-link paragraph-medium" href="https://portal.dtcc.com/">MyDTCC</a></div><div class="header-dropdown__menu-item"><a role="menuitem" class="header-dropdown__menu-link paragraph-medium" href="https://dtcclearning.com/">DTCC Learning</a></div></div></div></div></div></header><!--/$--><main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="grow scroll-mt-24 outline-offset-2"><!--$--><!--/$--><div data-test="masthead-wrapper"><div><div class="content-area "><div class="content-item content-item--subpagemastheadblock"><section aria-labelledby="section-subpage-masthead-heading--R5ekveokq-" class="subpage-masthead" data-background-media-theme="dark" data-banner-height="small" data-content-animation-enabled="true" data-has-background-media="true"><div class="subpage-masthead__outer subpage-masthead__outer--with-media" data-theme="dark" style="--subpage-masthead-gradient:var(--banner-gradient-left)"><div aria-hidden="true" class="subpage-masthead__media" style="--banner-media-opacity:1"><div class="subpage-masthead__media-backdrop"></div><img alt="Clearing&amp;Settlement_Masthead_r1.jpg" fetchPriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="subpage-masthead__bg-image" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/Clearing%26Settlement_Masthead_r1.jpg/Zz1jMjc5NmQ4NjhkMGUxMWYxYTU5MzQyYmFkNzI2NTVlYQ==?width=640&amp;quality=85 640w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/Clearing%26Settlement_Masthead_r1.jpg/Zz1jMjc5NmQ4NjhkMGUxMWYxYTU5MzQyYmFkNzI2NTVlYQ==?width=750&amp;quality=85 750w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/Clearing%26Settlement_Masthead_r1.jpg/Zz1jMjc5NmQ4NjhkMGUxMWYxYTU5MzQyYmFkNzI2NTVlYQ==?width=828&amp;quality=85 828w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/Clearing%26Settlement_Masthead_r1.jpg/Zz1jMjc5NmQ4NjhkMGUxMWYxYTU5MzQyYmFkNzI2NTVlYQ==?width=960&amp;quality=85 960w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/Clearing%26Settlement_Masthead_r1.jpg/Zz1jMjc5NmQ4NjhkMGUxMWYxYTU5MzQyYmFkNzI2NTVlYQ==?width=1080&amp;quality=85 1080w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/Clearing%26Settlement_Masthead_r1.jpg/Zz1jMjc5NmQ4NjhkMGUxMWYxYTU5MzQyYmFkNzI2NTVlYQ==?width=1200&amp;quality=85 1200w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/Clearing%26Settlement_Masthead_r1.jpg/Zz1jMjc5NmQ4NjhkMGUxMWYxYTU5MzQyYmFkNzI2NTVlYQ==?width=1280&amp;quality=85 1280w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/Clearing%26Settlement_Masthead_r1.jpg/Zz1jMjc5NmQ4NjhkMGUxMWYxYTU5MzQyYmFkNzI2NTVlYQ==?width=1600&amp;quality=85 1600w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/Clearing%26Settlement_Masthead_r1.jpg/Zz1jMjc5NmQ4NjhkMGUxMWYxYTU5MzQyYmFkNzI2NTVlYQ==?width=1920&amp;quality=85 1920w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/Clearing%26Settlement_Masthead_r1.jpg/Zz1jMjc5NmQ4NjhkMGUxMWYxYTU5MzQyYmFkNzI2NTVlYQ==?width=2048&amp;quality=85 2048w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/Clearing%26Settlement_Masthead_r1.jpg/Zz1jMjc5NmQ4NjhkMGUxMWYxYTU5MzQyYmFkNzI2NTVlYQ==?width=3840&amp;quality=85 3840w" src="https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/Clearing%26Settlement_Masthead_r1.jpg/Zz1jMjc5NmQ4NjhkMGUxMWYxYTU5MzQyYmFkNzI2NTVlYQ==?width=3840&amp;quality=85"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="subpage-masthead__gradient"></div><div class="container subpage-masthead__container"><div class="subpage-masthead__surface" data-theme="dark"><div class="subpage-masthead__layout"><div class="subpage-masthead__content"><div class="subpage-masthead__content-group"><div class="subpage-masthead__copy"><div class="subpage-masthead__intro"><h1 class="heading-2 subpage-masthead__heading is-visible" id="section-subpage-masthead-heading--R5ekveokq-">Clearing &amp; Settlement Services</h1><div class="subpage-masthead__description is-visible"><div class="paragraph-medium rtf">Every day, DTCC helps keep the world's financial markets moving. We process trillions of dollars in securities transactions daily and quadrillions annually, delivering the scale, resiliency and certainty market participants need as settlement cycles accelerate and automation expands.</div></div></div><div class="subpage-masthead__actions is-visible"><a title="Contact Us" class="button button--primary button--large button--external" href="https://www.dtcc.com/products-and-services/clearing-settlement-services#ContactUs"><span class="button__label">Contact Us</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="button__icon button__icon--right button__icon--auto button__icon--external"></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></div><h1 class="sr-only">Clearing &amp; Settlement Services</h1><div><div class="content-area "><div class="content-item content-item--overviewcontainerblock" data-content-item-theme="light"><section data-theme="light" aria-labelledby="-R6qkveokq--heading" data-jump-link-title="" id="block-39853" class="overview-container py-stacked-component-lg"><div class="container"><div class="overview-container__wrapper  overview-container__wrapper--intro-only"><div class="overview-container__intro-heading"><h2 id="-R6qkveokq--heading" class="heading-2 overview-container__heading">Keeping Markets Moving </h2></div><div class="overview-container__intro-body"><div class="overview-container__description rtf paragraph-medium"><p>Financial markets are handling growing transaction volumes, faster settlement cycles and increasing complexity. To operate efficiently, market participants need a reliable way to manage risk and complete trades.</p>
<p>DTCC provides the infrastructure that helps make this possible across U.S. equities and fixed income markets. Through our clearing, settlement and asset servicing services, we help firms process transactions, manage obligations and complete trades with confidence.</p>
<p>By centralizing and automating these activities, we help reduce risk, improve operational performance and support the smooth functioning of the financial markets.&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class="content-item content-item--statcardscontainerblock" data-content-item-theme="light"><section data-jump-link-title="" data-theme="light" aria-label="Statistics" id="block-39855" class="stat-cards-container"><div class="container stat-cards-container__container stat-cards-container__container--filled"><div class="stat-cards-container__panel"><ul class="stat-cards-container__grid"><li class="stat-cards-container__item"><div style="--stat-card-fade-duration:400ms;transition-delay:0ms" class="stat-card"><div class="stat-card__number"><span aria-hidden="true" class="stat-card__number-accent" style="width:0%"></span><span class="stat-card__quantity" aria-label="$608"><span class="stat-card__quantity-sizer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="stat-card__symbol">$</span><span class="stat-card__digit">6</span><span class="stat-card__digit">0</span><span class="stat-card__digit">8</span></span><span class="stat-card__quantity-value" aria-hidden="true"><span class="stat-card__symbol"> </span><span class="stat-card__symbol"> </span><span class="stat-card__symbol">$</span><span class="stat-card__digit">0</span></span></span><span class="stat-card__unit card-title">Trillion</span></div><div class="stat-card__copy"><p class="stat-card__description paragraph-small">Equity transactions processed in 2025</p></div></div></li><li class="stat-cards-container__item"><div style="--stat-card-fade-duration:400ms;transition-delay:250ms" class="stat-card"><div class="stat-card__number"><span aria-hidden="true" class="stat-card__number-accent" style="width:0%"></span><span class="stat-card__quantity" aria-label="98%"><span class="stat-card__quantity-sizer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="stat-card__digit">9</span><span class="stat-card__digit">8</span><span class="stat-card__symbol">%</span></span><span class="stat-card__quantity-value" aria-hidden="true"><span class="stat-card__symbol"> </span><span class="stat-card__digit">0</span><span class="stat-card__symbol">%</span></span></span></div><div class="stat-card__copy"><p class="stat-card__description paragraph-small">Average reduction in payment obligations through multilateral netting</p></div></div></li><li class="stat-cards-container__item"><div style="--stat-card-fade-duration:400ms;transition-delay:500ms" class="stat-card"><div class="stat-card__number"><span aria-hidden="true" class="stat-card__number-accent" style="width:0%"></span><span class="stat-card__quantity" aria-label="545"><span class="stat-card__quantity-sizer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="stat-card__digit">5</span><span class="stat-card__digit">4</span><span class="stat-card__digit">5</span></span><span class="stat-card__quantity-value" aria-hidden="true"><span class="stat-card__symbol"> </span><span class="stat-card__symbol"> </span><span class="stat-card__digit">0</span></span></span><span class="stat-card__unit card-title">Million</span></div><div class="stat-card__copy"><p class="stat-card__description paragraph-small">Record equities transactions cleared in a single day</p></div></div></li><li class="stat-cards-container__item"><div style="--stat-card-fade-duration:400ms;transition-delay:750ms" class="stat-card"><div class="stat-card__number"><span aria-hidden="true" class="stat-card__number-accent" style="width:0%"></span><span class="stat-card__quantity" aria-label="$3.3"><span class="stat-card__quantity-sizer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="stat-card__symbol">$</span><span class="stat-card__digit">3</span><span class="stat-card__symbol">.</span><span class="stat-card__digit">3</span></span><span class="stat-card__quantity-value" aria-hidden="true"><span class="stat-card__symbol"> </span><span class="stat-card__symbol"> </span><span class="stat-card__symbol">$</span><span class="stat-card__digit">0</span></span></span><span class="stat-card__unit card-title">Quadrillion</span></div><div class="stat-card__copy"><p class="stat-card__description paragraph-small">Government securities transactions processed in 2025</p></div></div></li></ul><p class="stat-cards-container__footnote paragraph-x-small">Data as of Q4 2025</p></div></div></section></div><div class="content-item content-item--featuregridcontainerblock" data-content-item-theme="light"><section data-jump-link-title="" data-theme="light" aria-labelledby="feature-grid-container--Reqkveokq--heading" id="block-39865" class="feature-grid-container feature-grid-container--checks"><div class="feature-grid-container__inner container py-stacked-component-lg"><div class="feature-grid-container__header feature-grid-container__header--no-description"><div class="feature-grid-container__heading-blurb"><h2 id="feature-grid-container--Reqkveokq--heading" class="feature-grid-container__heading heading-3">Delivering Value</h2></div></div><div class="feature-grid-container__grid"><article class="feature-grid-card feature-grid-card--check "><span aria-hidden="true" class="check-bubble"><svg class="check-bubble__icon" viewBox="0 0 11 10" fill="none" focusable="false"><path d="M9.33333 1.79468L4.27381 8.20539L1 4.94944" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></span><div class="feature-grid-card__content"><div class="feature-grid-card__copy"><h3 class="feature-grid-card__heading heading-5">Central Counterparty Protection</h3><div class="feature-grid-card__description paragraph-medium rtf">By standing between buyers and sellers, we help ensure the completion of eligible transactions while reducing counterparty risk.</div></div></div></article><article class="feature-grid-card feature-grid-card--check "><span aria-hidden="true" class="check-bubble"><svg class="check-bubble__icon" viewBox="0 0 11 10" fill="none" focusable="false"><path d="M9.33333 1.79468L4.27381 8.20539L1 4.94944" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></span><div class="feature-grid-card__content"><div class="feature-grid-card__copy"><h3 class="feature-grid-card__heading heading-5">Multilateral Netting Efficiency</h3><div class="feature-grid-card__description paragraph-medium rtf">Our netting capabilities significantly reduce settlement obligations, freeing liquidity and reducing operational burdens across the marketplace.</div></div></div></article><article class="feature-grid-card feature-grid-card--check "><span aria-hidden="true" class="check-bubble"><svg class="check-bubble__icon" viewBox="0 0 11 10" fill="none" focusable="false"><path d="M9.33333 1.79468L4.27381 8.20539L1 4.94944" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></span><div class="feature-grid-card__content"><div class="feature-grid-card__copy"><h3 class="feature-grid-card__heading heading-5">Market-Scale Processing</h3><div class="feature-grid-card__description paragraph-medium rtf">Infrastructure engineered to support trillions of dollars in daily activity and periods of elevated market volatility.</div></div></div></article><article class="feature-grid-card feature-grid-card--check "><span aria-hidden="true" class="check-bubble"><svg class="check-bubble__icon" viewBox="0 0 11 10" fill="none" focusable="false"><path d="M9.33333 1.79468L4.27381 8.20539L1 4.94944" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></span><div class="feature-grid-card__content"><div class="feature-grid-card__copy"><h3 class="feature-grid-card__heading heading-5">Keeping Pace with Market Change</h3><div class="feature-grid-card__description paragraph-medium rtf">Support evolving settlement and operating models, including T+1 and 24x5 processing capabilities.</div></div></div></article><article class="feature-grid-card feature-grid-card--check "><span aria-hidden="true" class="check-bubble"><svg class="check-bubble__icon" viewBox="0 0 11 10" fill="none" focusable="false"><path d="M9.33333 1.79468L4.27381 8.20539L1 4.94944" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></span><div class="feature-grid-card__content"><div class="feature-grid-card__copy"><h3 class="feature-grid-card__heading heading-5">Enhanced Transparency</h3><div class="feature-grid-card__description paragraph-medium rtf">Centralized clearing creates greater visibility, standardization and operational consistency across participants.</div></div></div></article><article class="feature-grid-card feature-grid-card--check "><span aria-hidden="true" class="check-bubble"><svg class="check-bubble__icon" viewBox="0 0 11 10" fill="none" focusable="false"><path d="M9.33333 1.79468L4.27381 8.20539L1 4.94944" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></span><div class="feature-grid-card__content"><div class="feature-grid-card__copy"><h3 class="feature-grid-card__heading heading-5">Resilient Infrastructure</h3><div class="feature-grid-card__description paragraph-medium rtf">Our critical infrastructure is designed to support market continuity during periods of heightened activity and stress.</div></div></div></article></div></div></section></div><div class="content-item content-item--generictextcardscontainerblock" data-content-item-theme="light-green"><section data-theme="light-green" aria-label="Text Cards Container" data-columns="3" data-layout="grid" data-component-layout="grid" data-intro-heading-size="heading-small" data-jump-link-title="" id="block-39860" class="generic-text-card-container"><div class="container generic-text-card-container__inner"><h3 class="heading-3 generic-text-card-container__heading text-inherit" id="section-generic-text-cards-container-heading--Riqkveokq-">Explore Our Services</h3><div class="generic-text-card-container__description pt-sm"><div class="rtf paragraph-medium text-inherit"><p>We deliver critical clearing, settlement and risk management capabilities across the U.S. equities and fixed income ecosystem.&nbsp;</p></div></div><ul class="generic-text-card-container__cards"><li><article class="generic-card generic-card--with-image generic-card--product-promo card-zoom relative"><a target="_self" class="generic-card__card-link" href="https://www.dtcc.com/products-and-services/clearing-settlement-services/equities-clearing"><div class="generic-card__image-wrapper"><img alt="DTCC_FICC_EquitiesClearing.jpg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover card-zoom__image" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 359px) 295px, (max-width: 767px) 228px, (max-width: 1279px) 337px, (max-width: 1599px) 438px, 524px" srcSet="https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquitiesClearing.jpg/Zz02NDFmNGE4NGFjODExMWYxYWM2NWQyMjRjMGQzYzc2ZA==?width=16&amp;quality=75 16w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquitiesClearing.jpg/Zz02NDFmNGE4NGFjODExMWYxYWM2NWQyMjRjMGQzYzc2ZA==?width=32&amp;quality=75 32w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquitiesClearing.jpg/Zz02NDFmNGE4NGFjODExMWYxYWM2NWQyMjRjMGQzYzc2ZA==?width=48&amp;quality=75 48w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquitiesClearing.jpg/Zz02NDFmNGE4NGFjODExMWYxYWM2NWQyMjRjMGQzYzc2ZA==?width=64&amp;quality=75 64w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquitiesClearing.jpg/Zz02NDFmNGE4NGFjODExMWYxYWM2NWQyMjRjMGQzYzc2ZA==?width=96&amp;quality=75 96w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquitiesClearing.jpg/Zz02NDFmNGE4NGFjODExMWYxYWM2NWQyMjRjMGQzYzc2ZA==?width=128&amp;quality=75 128w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquitiesClearing.jpg/Zz02NDFmNGE4NGFjODExMWYxYWM2NWQyMjRjMGQzYzc2ZA==?width=256&amp;quality=75 256w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquitiesClearing.jpg/Zz02NDF