><div class="generic-card__copy"><h4 class="generic-card__heading heading-5">Equities Clearing (NSCC)</h4><div class="generic-card__description rtf paragraph-small">Every trading day, clearing helps reduce risk, free up capital and keep markets running smoothly. DTCC’s National Securities Clearing Corporation (NSCC) combines millions of transactions into fewer, simpler obligations, making them easier and less costly for firms to manage.</div></div><span class="sr-only">Learn More</span></div></a></article></li><li><article class="generic-card generic-card--with-image generic-card--product-promo card-zoom relative"><a target="_self" class="generic-card__card-link" href="https://www.dtcc.com/products-and-services/clearing-settlement-services/equities-settlement"><div class="generic-card__image-wrapper"><img alt="DTCC_FICC_EquititesSettlement.jpg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover card-zoom__image" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 359px) 295px, (max-width: 767px) 228px, (max-width: 1279px) 337px, (max-width: 1599px) 438px, 524px" srcSet="https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquititesSettlement.jpg/Zz02MzljYzM1Y2FjODExMWYxYWEyZDI2NDZlZDA1NTQ4YQ==?width=16&amp;quality=75 16w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquititesSettlement.jpg/Zz02MzljYzM1Y2FjODExMWYxYWEyZDI2NDZlZDA1NTQ4YQ==?width=32&amp;quality=75 32w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquititesSettlement.jpg/Zz02MzljYzM1Y2FjODExMWYxYWEyZDI2NDZlZDA1NTQ4YQ==?width=48&amp;quality=75 48w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquititesSettlement.jpg/Zz02MzljYzM1Y2FjODExMWYxYWEyZDI2NDZlZDA1NTQ4YQ==?width=64&amp;quality=75 64w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquititesSettlement.jpg/Zz02MzljYzM1Y2FjODExMWYxYWEyZDI2NDZlZDA1NTQ4YQ==?width=96&amp;quality=75 96w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquititesSettlement.jpg/Zz02MzljYzM1Y2F