NTQ4YQ==?width=3840&amp;quality=75 3840w" src="https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_EquititesSettlement.jpg/Zz02MzljYzM1Y2FjODExMWYxYWEyZDI2NDZlZDA1NTQ4YQ==?width=3840&amp;quality=75"/><span class="action-button action-button--primary action-button--large" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div class="generic-card__body"><div class="generic-card__copy"><h4 class="generic-card__heading heading-5">Equities Settlement (DTC)</h4><div class="generic-card__description rtf paragraph-small">Once a trade is cleared, settlement makes it final. Every day, we help move securities and payments between market participants, completing transactions safely, efficiently and at scale. </div></div><span class="sr-only">Learn More</span></div></a></article></li><li><article class="generic-card generic-card--with-image generic-card--product-promo card-zoom relative"><a target="_self" class="generic-card__card-link" href="https://www.dtcc.com/products-and-services/clearing-settlement-services/fixed-income-clearing-corporation-ficc"><div class="generic-card__image-wrapper"><img alt="DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover card-zoom__image" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 359px) 295px, (max-width: 767px) 228px, (max-width: 1279px) 337px, (max-width: 1599px) 438px, 524px" srcSet="https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=16&amp;quality=75 16w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=32&amp;quality=75 32w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=48&amp;quality=75 48w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=64&amp;quality=75 64w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=96&amp;quality=75 96w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=128&amp;quality=75 128w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=256&amp;quality=75 256w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=384&amp;quality=75 384w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=640&amp;quality=75 640w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=750&amp;quality=75 750w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=828&amp;quality=75 828w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=960&amp;quality=75 960w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=1080&amp;quality=75 1080w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=1200&amp;quality=75 1200w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=1280&amp;quality=75 1280w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=1600&amp;quality=75 1600w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=1920&amp;quality=75 1920w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=2048&amp;quality=75 2048w, https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=3840&amp;quality=75 3840w" src="https://files.dtcc.com/images/assets/DTCC_FICC_FICC.jpg/Zz02NDI0YTA0Y2FjODExMWYxOTBlNWZlYWY3YjA1ZTE0Mw==?width=3840&amp;quality=75"/><span class="action-button action-button--primary action-button--large" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div class="generic-card__body"><div class="generic-card__copy"><h4 class="generic-card__heading heading-5">Fixed Income Clearing (FICC)</h4><div class="generic-card__description rtf paragraph-small">For more than 40 years, Fixed Income Clearing Corporation (FICC) has helped market participants manage risk, improve efficiency and support liquidity across the U.S. Treasury and agency mortgage-backed securities markets through trusted clearing and post-trade infrastructure.</div></div><span class="sr-only">Learn More</span></div></a></article></li></ul></div></section></div><div class="content-item content-item--accordioncontainerblock" data-content-item-theme="light"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><div class="content-skeleton" role="status" aria-label="Loading content..." style="width:100%;background-color:grey;animation:skeleton-pulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;margin-bottom:16px;--content-skeleton-desktop-large-height:880px;--content-skeleton-height:960px"></div><!--/$--></div><div class="content-item content-item--formcontainerblock" data-content-item-theme="light"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><div class="content-skeleton" role="status" aria-label="Loading content..." style="width:100%;background-color:grey;animation:skeleton-pulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;margin-bottom:16px;--content-skeleton-desktop-large-height:160px;--content-skeleton-height:160px"></div><!--/$--></div></div></div></main><!--$--><footer class="footer footer--reskin" data-theme="gray"><div class="footer__container container"><ul class="footer__navigation-links" aria-label="Footer navigation"><li><div class="footer-panel footer-panel--reskin faq-accordion"><button c